The text of A Hebrew and English Lexicon of the Old Testament by Francis
Brown, S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs (Oxford, 1906) is in the public
domain; the text in this file is from Sefaria's BDB Dictionary and BDB
Aramaic Dictionary.

Open Scriptures' data in this file (ids, short definitions, Strong's and
TWOT numbers, from the HebrewLexicon; the lemmas used for linking, from the
Open Scriptures Hebrew Bible) remains available under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0), credit: Open Scriptures
Hebrew Bible Project.

The links to the lexemes of the BHSA derive from the BHSA (ETCBC), which is
licensed under CC BY-NC 4.0.
